{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "皆さんこんにちは"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "海邉朱莉です。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "寒くなったり暖かくなったりと忙しない気候が続いていますが、元気でいますか？"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "体調崩してない？"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "良いことも良くないことも色んなことあって振り回されちゃうけど、\n皆さんがいてくれて、このブログを読みに来てくれて本当に嬉しいし、ありがとうといつも思っています。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "毎日お疲れさま。\nこんな私だけど、皆さんの力に少しでもなれていたら嬉しいです。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "最近は同期と色んなところに行ったりしてました。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "お買い物とかクリスマスマーケットとかご飯とか。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "想い出が増えていくことがとても嬉しいです！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202512/mobnsNz2A.png", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202512/mobXTjuFc.png", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202512/mobGOLnAl.png", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "この日はちょっと寒かった日。\nひなのに巻いてもらったマフラーが嬉しくて、帰ってすぐに撮りました。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "まだまだ色んなところ行きたいね。\n行こうね。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "最後まで読んでいただき、ありがとうございました！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "海邉朱莉"}], "source": "official"}